NUM_OF_PROB
1		single problem
PROBLE_NAME
101		102 - pure convection in x direction
MESHFIL_TYP
2		2-2D unstructured mesh data
CONTROL_PAR
INIT
0		1-initial data applied at t=0 and supplied for linear solver
NRMA
-1		0-no material data specified (coefficients given in the code)
SLOP
0		1-default slope limiter
IMPL
0.5 		0.5 - Crank-Nicholson time integration scheme
PENA
0 		0-no penalty terms => NDG formulation
FREE
0.7		0.5 - strong slope limiting
BCON
1		1-set of BC data
1		1-number for the first set (<10 - Dirichlet data)
1.0		value
ICON
1		1-set of initial data
0.0             0.0 - initialize solution to zero in all elements
TIME_PARAMS
1 2		1-default time integration scheme, 0-output level: no output 
STEP
0 5		1-current step, 20-final step
TIME
0.0 600		0-current time, 0.6-final time
DTIM
5.0 5.0		0.03-current time step length, 0.03-previous time step length
CONV
0 0.0 		0-convergence type, 0-convergence treshold
INTV
0 0 		0-no automatic dumpouts, 0-no automatic graphics output
NONL_PARAMS
0 0		0-no nonlinear solver, 0-output level: no output 
CONV
0 0 0 		0-max_iter, 0-convergence type, 0-convergence treshold 
LINS_PARAMS
1 2		1-single level GMRES solver, 2-convergence data output level
CONV
100 1 1.e-6 	100-max_iter, 1-rel_ini convergence, 1.e-6-convergence treshold
ADAPT_PARAM
1 2		0-no automatic adaptation, 0-output level: no output 
CTRL
1 2 1		0-interval between adaptations, 4-max_gen, 10-max_gen_diff  
TOLE
0.001 0.01 	tolerance: 0.005-global level, 0.01-ratio for de-refinements



